<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle shr rise after 16.6 profit rise.</title>
<headline>Nestle shr rise after 16.6 profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss food group Nestle SA's shares were trading 50 Swiss francs higher at 1,627 following news that 1996 net profit rose 16.6 percent to 3.40 billion francs and that the group raised the dividend on 1996 results.</p>
<p>The consensus forecast had called for a 10.5 percent group profit rise to 3.23 billion.</p>
<p>Nestle also increased its dividend to 30 francs per share from 26.50 francs. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
